/* zh-SG translations for "ch1" (generated by tools/i18n-pack.js; keys are the English source). */
Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 1": "第一章",
  "First Week of JC": "初院第一周",
  "Part I — Rose-Tinted": "第一部 · 玫瑰色",
  "Chapter 2 — The Group Date": "第二章 · 集体出游",
  "February. Orientation week at Bayview JC. 6:52 AM.": "二月，湾景初院迎新周。早上六点五十二分。",
  "Last year in Sec 4, {name} confessed to a girl at the canteen drinks stall. She said \"eww\" and ordered a bandung.": "去年中四，{name}在食堂饮料摊跟一个女生表白。她说了一声“咦——”，然后转头跟安娣点了杯玫瑰露。",
  "New school. Nobody here knows about the bandung. This year, confirm got girlfriend. ...Probably.": "新学校，没人知道玫瑰露那件事。今年一定要脱单。……大概吧。",
  "*bzzzt*. The phone on the desk lights up. Nobody is calling.": "*嗡——*　桌上的手机自己亮了。没有来电。",
  "Nyaa~! Morning! I'm Mochi, Love God, trainee grade. Your phone just got picked for LOVE TRAINING!": "喵～早安！我是麻糬，恋爱之神，见习的那种。你的手机被抽中参加——恋爱特训！",
  "A cat. In my phone. Okay. Still dreaming.": "手机里……有只猫。好。我还没睡醒。",
  "My final exam is you. One hopeless boy, one year, one actual clue about love. No pick-up lines.": "我的毕业考试就是你。一个没救的男生，一年时间，教会你一点真正的恋爱常识。撩妹金句不算。",
  "Your choices move people closer or further. Some are traps. Some end very, very badly.": "你每个选择都会把人拉近或推远。有的是陷阱，有的……结局会很惨。",
  "Relax. If you crash, I rewind. Once. Twice. Okay, as many times as it takes.": "放心，搞砸了我帮你倒带。一次，两次……好啦，要几次都行。",
  "*knock knock knock*": "*咚咚咚*",
  "{name}! Orientation starts at 7:30! Don't tell me you're still in your pyjamas.": "{name}！七点半就集合了！你不会还穿着睡衣吧？",
  "Nur Hanis. Same HDB corridor since K1. She was there for the bandung. She was there for everything.": "努尔·哈妮丝。从幼稚园就住同一条组屋走廊。玫瑰露事件她在场，你所有的糗事她都在场。",
  "Also. My mum cooked too much nasi lemak, so... here. Leftovers. Don't make it weird.": "还有……我妈椰浆饭煮太多了，给你。剩的啦。你别多想。",
  "The tupperware is wrapped in a cloth with cat faces on it. Inside, the egg has been cut into little hearts. Very leftover.": "保鲜盒外面包着一块小猫图案的布。打开一看，煎蛋被切成了一颗颗小爱心。嗯，很“剩”。",
  "Oh ya, my birthday's the Friday after next. Not that I'm expecting anything. At all.": "对了，我生日是下下个礼拜五。不是要你准备什么啊。完全没有。",
  "First one. Look properly, rookie.": "第一题。看仔细点，菜鸟。",
  "Hanis holds out the box...": "哈妮丝把饭盒递过来……",
  "\"Thanks, Hanis. Wait, you cut the egg into hearts? Okay, my morning is made.\"": "“谢啦。诶，蛋切成爱心？好，我今天一整天都开心了。”",
  "You— you saw that?! ...Hearts are easier to cut, okay. Everyone knows.": "你、你有看到喔？！……爱心比较好切啦。常识好不好。",
  "Go change. Five minutes. I'm waiting at the lift.": "快去换衣服，给你五分钟。我在电梯口等。",
  "\"Leftovers, huh? Trying to make me fat so no one else wants me?\"": "“剩的？想把我喂胖，好让别人都不要我是吧？”",
  "Hah?! You don't need my help for that. You're doing great on your own.": "哈？！这个不用我帮忙，你自己就做得很好了。",
  "...But finish it. All of it.": "……不过要吃完哦。全部。",
  "(Keep scrolling TikTok.) \"Mm. Just put it on the table.\"": "（继续滑TikTok）“嗯，放桌上就好。”",
  "...Okay. I go first.": "……喔。那我先走了。",
  "She was up at six cutting hearts. You showed her the top of your head.": "她六点就起来切爱心。你给她看的是你的头顶。",
  "The covered walkway to the MRT. Frangipani on the ground, everyone in uniforms that still have the fold lines.": "去地铁站的有盖走廊。地上落着鸡蛋花，大家的新校服都还有折痕。",
  "Someone walks straight into you, eyes on her phone. Iced kopi everywhere. Mostly on her.": "有人低头看着手机，一头撞上你。冰咖啡洒了一地——大部分洒在她自己身上。",
  "Oh my gosh, sorry sorry! ...Wait. Have we met? Your face is so familiar.": "啊对不起对不起！……等一下，我们是不是见过？你好眼熟哦。",
  "Okay this sounds crazy, but I think we're soulmates. I can feel it. I'm Rae.": "我知道这样讲很怪，但我觉得我们是灵魂伴侣。真的，我感觉得到。我叫瑞儿。",
  "Rae Koh. Perfect hair, perfect smile. Nobody in your batch has ever seen her before.": "许瑞儿。头发完美，笑容完美。整个年级没有人见过她。",
  "Eh, you look smart. My uncle showed me this app, MoonRich. My money doubled in one week. We can grow it together~": "诶，你看起来很聪明。我uncle介绍我一个app叫MoonRich，我的钱一个礼拜就翻倍了。我们一起赚嘛～",
  "Hm. My whiskers are tingling.": "嗯……我的胡须在抖。",
  "Rae holds out her phone, MoonRich already open...": "瑞儿把手机递过来，MoonRich已经打开了……",
  "\"Soulmates?! Okay! I'll put in my savings!\"": "“灵魂伴侣？！好啊！我把存款都放进去！”",
  "Yay, I knew you were different! Just scan this QR...": "耶，我就知道你不一样！扫这个QR码就可以了……",
  "One week later, MoonRich won't open. Rae's Telegram says \"Deleted Account\".": "一个礼拜后，MoonRich打不开了。瑞儿的Telegram显示：“已注销账号”。",
  "BAD END #1 — The Soulmate Portfolio": "坏结局 #1 · 灵魂伴侣投资组合",
  "Savings: $0. Soulmate: gone. \"Soulmate\" in minute one and an app in minute two? She was looking at your wallet, not at you.": "存款：$0。灵魂伴侣：失联。第一分钟叫你灵魂伴侣，第二分钟就拿出投资app？她看的是你的钱包，不是你。",
  "\"Haha, we met like thirty seconds ago. Here, I've got tissue for the kopi.\"": "“哈哈，我们才认识三十秒欸。来，先拿纸巾擦一下咖啡。”",
  "...Huh. You're no fun.": "……哦。你好无聊。",
  "Most boys just say yes, you know. See you around, {name}.": "一般男生都直接说好的。回头见咯，{name}。",
  "...I never told her my name.": "……我没跟她说过我的名字啊。",
  "\"No money, sorry. But... here's my Telegram.\"": "“我没钱啦。不过……这是我的Telegram。”",
  "Aww, no money? Okay lah. I'll text you, soulmate~": "没钱啊？好啦好啦。我会传简讯给你的，灵魂伴侣～",
  "Wallet closed, good. Door open, hmm.": "钱包关上了，很好。门却开了，嗯……",
  "Lunch break. The library aircon is set to \"durian storage\". You are here for the aircon.": "午休。图书馆冷气开得像榴梿冷藏库。你是来吹冷气的。",
  "A girl on tiptoe at the top shelf. A book slips, bounces once, lands by your shoe.": "一个女生踮着脚够最上层的书。一本书滑下来，弹了一下，停在你鞋边。",
  "\"The Starlight Postman\", volume 7. A fantasy series about a boy who delivers letters between stars.": "《星光邮差》第七集。讲一个在星星之间送信的少年。",
  "...S-sorry. That's mine.": "……对、对不起。那是我的。",
  "Lim Xin Yi. Same civics class. Hasn't said a word all week. Her bookmark is an old SBS bus ticket.": "林欣怡，同一个班。这个礼拜一句话都没说过。她的书签是一张很旧的巴士车票。",
  "Read the room. Not just the cover.": "读空气。别光看封面。",
  "You pick up the book...": "你把书捡起来……",
  "\"Starlight Postman? Is it good?\" (Ask, listen, then let her go back to reading.)": "“《星光邮差》？好看吗？”（问一句，听她讲，然后让她继续看书）",
  "You... want to know? Um. The letters take a hundred years to arrive. So people write to someone they'll never meet.": "你……想知道哦？嗯……信要一百年才会寄到。所以大家都在写信给一个永远见不到的人。",
  "Volume 3 is the saddest. If you read it... we can talk about it. If you want.": "第三集最好哭。你如果看了的话……我们可以聊。如果你想的话。",
  "She goes back to her book. You go back to the aircon. That's it. It's nice.": "她低头继续看书，你继续吹你的冷气。就这样。挺好的。",
  "(Grab her hand.) \"This is fate. We were meant to meet here.\"": "（一把抓住她的手）“这是缘分。我们注定在这里相遇。”",
  "She drops the book and runs. Next morning, your civics tutor asks you to come to the staff room.": "她丢下书就跑了。第二天早上，班导叫你去一趟教职员办公室。",
  "BAD END #2 — The Staff Room Would Like a Word": "坏结局 #2 · 请到办公室一趟",
  "In anime, grabbing her hand is romantic. In a real library, with a stranger, it's just scary. Ask first. Every time.": "动画里抓手很浪漫。现实里在图书馆抓一个陌生人的手，只会吓到人。先问。每一次都要。",
  "\"Starlight Postman? That one's for primary school kids, right?\"": "“《星光邮差》？那不是小学生看的吗？”",
  "...It's not.": "……才不是。",
  "Ouch. That book was a piece of her. She'll remember.": "哎呀。那本书是她的一部分。她会记得的。",
  "After CCA trials, Kavya Pillai from track said, \"Wait for me at the field after school.\" You've been waiting 45 minutes. Your Milo is warm now.": "田径队试训后，卡维娅·皮莱说：“放学在操场等我。”你已经等了四十五分钟，美禄都变温了。",
  "She finally jogs up, ponytail swinging, spikes in one hand.": "她终于小跑过来，马尾一甩一甩，手里拎着钉鞋。",
  "Oh. You actually waited? 😏": "哦？你真的等哦？😏",
  "Eh, something came up. Next time maybe. Or not. See how.": "诶，临时有事。下次吧。或者不要。看情况。",
  "Hot, cold, hot. Classic.": "一冷一热一冷。经典款。",
  "Kavya looks at you, waiting...": "卡维娅看着你，等你开口……",
  "\"Of course! I'd wait for you every day ♡\"": "“当然啦！为你我每天都愿意等♡”",
  "Every day? Cute. Then wait tomorrow also.": "每天？好可爱。那明天也继续等咯。",
  "Say you'll take anything, and anything is what you'll get.": "你说什么都可以，人家就真的随便给你了。",
  "\"No worries. Next time just text me if plans change, can? Want to do another day?\"": "“没事。下次改时间传个简讯就好，可以吗？要不要换一天？”",
  "...Huh. Okay. Fair.": "……哦。好。有道理。",
  "Saturday. The café near the MRT, after training. I'll really come this time. Promise.": "礼拜六，地铁站旁边那家咖啡店，练完跑步之后。这次我真的会来。保证。",
  "(Post an IG story with a sad song: \"some people don't keep promises 💔\")": "（发一条配伤感歌的IG限时动态：“有些人说话不算话💔”）",
  "Seriously? You posted about me? Wow.": "不是吧？你发动态内涵我？哇。",
  "One game invites another. A text would've been faster.": "你玩一招，她就回一招。直接传简讯快多了。",
  "Thursday, canteen. The chicken rice queue is eight people long. A guy with a fade and a basketball drops into the seat beside you.": "礼拜四，食堂。鸡饭摊排了八个人。一个剃着渐变头、夹着篮球的男生一屁股坐到你旁边。",
  "Bro! Haziq. Same CT. We're friends now, settled.": "兄弟！我哈齐克，同班的。从今天起我们是朋友了，就这样决定。",
  "Hanis, lend me your chem tutorial to copy lah. Friends don't say no, right?": "哈妮丝，化学作业借我抄一下嘛。朋友不会拒绝朋友的，对吧？",
  "No. But I'll explain Question 3 to you at recess.": "不要。不过休息时间我可以教你第三题。",
  "Wah. Cold sia.": "哇，好冷酷哦。",
  "Haziq says real friends never say no. {n:hina} disagrees. Your turn.": "哈齐克说真正的朋友从来不会说不。{n:hina}不同意。轮到你了。",
  "\"I think I'm with you. But why does it matter so much to you?\"": "“我觉得我跟你同一边。不过，为什么这件事对你那么重要？”",
  "So: can a real friend say no?": "所以：真正的朋友可以说不吗？",
  "\"A real friend can hear no, and still be your friend.\"": "“真正的朋友听到不，还是你的朋友。”",
  "\"If you say no to a friend, you're not really a friend.\"": "“你跟朋友说不，就不算真朋友。”",
  "You talked about what you each want.": "你们聊了彼此想要的是什么。",
  "\"Yeah. Whatever you think. I agree.\"": "“嗯。你觉得怎样都行。我同意。”",
  "\"Haziq, that's the dumbest thing I've heard all week.\"": "“哈齐克，这是我这礼拜听过最蠢的话。”",
  "\"Eh. Can we talk about something else?\"": "“呃。我们能聊点别的吗？”",
  "Okay okay, Question 3 at recess. ...Wait, what's a mole actually?": "好啦好啦，休息时间第三题。……等等，摩尔到底是什么？",
  "GP tutorial. Mr. Lim asks whether social media makes people lonelier. Before anyone else has opened their mouth, a girl in the front row has answered, with three sub-points.": "GP 导修课。林老师问社交媒体是不是让人更孤单。还没人开口，前排一个女生已经回答了，还分了三个小点。",
  "...and thirdly, \"connection\" isn't the same as company. Sorry. I'll stop. Somebody else go.": "……第三，“联系”不等于“陪伴”。抱歉，我不说了。换别人讲吧。",
  "She answered the GP question in three sub-points.": "她用三个小点回答了 GP 的问题。",
  "She catches you looking.": "她发现你在看她。",
  "Tell her the third point was good. Ask what she meant.": "跟她说第三点讲得好，问她是什么意思。",
  "Company is someone who'd notice if you weren't there. ...Okay, now I sound like a poster. I'm Preet.": "陪伴，就是你不在的时候，会有人发现。……好吧，我现在听起来像一张海报。我是普丽特。",
  "Roll your eyes. Know-it-all.": "翻个白眼。万事通。",
  "Noted. First impressions are a draft, rookie. Don't print it yet.": "记下了。第一印象只是草稿，新手。先别急着打印。",
  "Recess. Under the frangipani tree by the field, a girl you don't know is lying flat on the grass, pointing an old film camera straight up.": "课间休息。操场边的鸡蛋花树下，一个你不认识的女生平躺在草地上，举着一台旧胶片相机对准天空。",
  "Okay, real talk. What's this tree called? It smells like sunscreen and heaven.": "好，说真的。这棵树叫什么？闻起来像防晒霜加天堂。",
  "Ava Mitchell. Transfer student: Texas, then Shanghai, then Dubai, now here. Third day. She already knows the canteen auntie's name.": "艾娃·米切尔。转学生：德州，然后上海，然后迪拜，现在是这里。才第三天，她已经知道食堂阿姨叫什么名字了。",
  "She's waiting for an answer, camera still up.": "她在等你回答，相机还举着。",
  "\"Frangipani. In Malay it's bunga kemboja. My Ah Ma calls it 鸡蛋花, egg flower.\"": "“Frangipani。马来文叫 bunga kemboja。我阿嬷叫它鸡蛋花。”",
  "Egg flower? Wait. White outside, yellow in the middle. That's so accurate I'm mad.": "鸡蛋花？等一下。外面白，中间黄。准到我有点不爽。",
  "Three names for one tree. Okay, this country is lowkey the best.": "一棵树三个名字。好吧，这个国家其实有点神。",
  "\"No idea. Some tree lah.\"": "“不知道啦。就一棵树咯。”",
  "Some tree lah. Noted. I'm gonna find out, come back and tell you, and you're gonna be so impressed.": "“就一棵树咯”。记下了。我会去查，回来告诉你，然后你会超佩服我。",
  "\"Er, you okay? Why are you lying on the grass?\"": "“呃，你还好吗？干嘛躺在草地上？”",
  "Best angle! You can't photograph a tree politely. You have to commit.": "最好的角度！拍树不能客客气气的，要豁出去。",
  "A week later there's a small print in your pigeonhole. One frangipani flower, a little out of focus. On the back: \"egg flower!! — A\"": "一个星期后，你的信格里多了一张小照片。一朵鸡蛋花，有点失焦。背面写着：“egg flower!! — A”",
  "She photographed the frangipani and left you the print.": "她拍了那朵鸡蛋花，还把照片留给你。",
  "11:40 PM. You should be asleep. Your phone buzzes.": "晚上十一点四十。你早该睡了。手机震了一下。",
  "Elise ✨": "伊莉丝 ✨",
  "heyyy {name} 🥺 can u do my GP essay outline?? ur SO smart": "嘿～{name} 🥺 可以帮我写GP作文大纲吗？？你超聪明的",
  "also there's this concert next month!! $120 a ticket. u'd get me one right? 💕": "还有下个月有个演唱会！！一张票$120。你会买给我的对吧？💕",
  "btw at KTV w my 3 besties rn lol. all guys hahaha": "对了我现在跟三个好朋友在唱K哈哈。都是男生哈哈哈",
  "Elise de Souza. Dance CCA, a few thousand followers, everybody's \"bestie\". She calls you most nights. You still don't know what you are to her.": "伊莉丝·德索萨。舞蹈社，几千个粉丝，谁都是她的“好朋友”。她几乎每晚都打给你。你到现在还不知道自己算她的什么。",
  "Last one for the week. Tricky.": "这礼拜最后一题。有点难哦。",
  "You stare at the screen...": "你盯着屏幕……",
  "\"Of course! I'll do the outline AND get the ticket!\"": "“当然！大纲我写，票我也买！”",
  "omg ur the BEST 😘😘 (sent 2:41 AM)": "天啊你最好了😘😘（凌晨2:41发送）",
  "So you're... her essay service? Her ATM? Blub blub, little fish.": "所以你是……她的代写服务？提款机？咕噜咕噜，小鱼一条。",
  "\"I can study with you tmr, but you write it. No ticket. Also, honest question: what are we?\"": "“明天可以陪你温书，但作文你自己写。票不买。还有，认真问一下：我们算什么？”",
  "...oh": "……哦",
  "honestly? nobody's asked me that before": "老实说？从来没有人这样问过我",
  "study tmr ok. talk then 🙂": "明天温书可以。到时候再聊🙂",
  "Scary question. Good question.": "很可怕的问题。也是很好的问题。",
  "(Fire off 14 jealous texts.) \"Who are these besties?? Why are you with them??\"": "（连发十四条吃醋简讯）“那些好朋友是谁？？你为什么跟他们在一起？？”",
  "who are they": "他们是谁",
  "why are u w them": "你干嘛跟他们一起",
  "reply": "回我",
  "⚠ Message not delivered.": "⚠ 信息未送达。",
  "BAD END #3 — Message Not Delivered": "坏结局 #3 · 信息未送达",
  "Fourteen messages, zero replies, one block. Jealousy is a feeling, not a plan. One clear question would have told you more.": "十四条简讯，零回复，一次封锁。吃醋是一种情绪，不是一个办法。一个清楚的问题，比十四条简讯有用多了。",
  "Later. The fan is on 3. You can't sleep.": "深夜。风扇开到三档，你睡不着。",
  "Phew. Week one: survived!": "呼——第一周，活下来了！",
  "Not bad, rookie. You looked at people, not just their sparkle.": "不错嘛菜鸟。你看的是人，不只是光环。",
  "Hmm. Lots to learn. Good thing I'm a patient cat.": "嗯……要学的还很多。还好我是一只很有耐心的猫。",
  "Rae 🌙": "瑞儿 🌙",
  "nightsss soulmate~ 🌙 dream of me ok": "晚安呀灵魂伴侣～🌙 要梦到我哦",
  "...Whiskers again. Hmm.": "……胡须又抖了。嗯。",
  "Also, you have a life. Grades, a hobby, sleep, money. Those bars up top? Keep them alive.": "还有，你自己也有生活：成绩、兴趣、睡眠、钱。上面那几条？别让它们见底。",
  "Next week: group outing. Wear something that isn't your PE shirt.": "下礼拜集体出游。拜托穿件不是体育服的衣服。"
});
